description	"MacZombie's Customer

^2Weaponry:
- Melee

^8Attributes:
- Melee Resistance
- View Ally Stats
- Acid Blood
- Strength (3)
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Close Combat Programming (1)

Another one of MacZombies many freakish customers that enjoy coming here. This is the cyborg, who likes to kill his meal before MacZombies prepare it into something poisonous for him to process in his half-metal hybrid stomach.
Cyborgs won't stand for the Imperial closure of the site - it's the only place they can take kills to be cooked. Perhaps if he was to kill the imperials, maybe he could get MacZombies to prepare the Imperial corpses into a fresh salad.
Then again, he could just eat them alive like the zombies do."